sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Citoyen
    participant FE as Angular
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant RS as Signalement
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant AI as Classification IA
    participant IS as Intervention
    participant DS as Département & Agent
    participant NS as Notification
    participant ES as Engagement

    C->>FE: Photo + position GPS
    FE->>GW: POST /api/reports (JWT)
    GW->>RS: POST /api/reports
    RS-->>FE: 201 Created (id de suivi)
    RS-)MQ: ReportCreated
    MQ-)AI: ReportCreated
    MQ-)NS: ReportCreated
    AI-)MQ: ReportClassified (catégorie, priorité)
    MQ-)RS: ReportClassified
    MQ-)IS: ReportClassified
    IS->>RS: GET /api/reports/{id} (OpenFeign)
    IS->>DS: GET /api/agents/available (OpenFeign + circuit breaker)
    alt Département indisponible
        IS-->>IS: Fallback : intervention PLANNED, affectation relancée
    end
    IS-)MQ: InterventionStatusChanged
    MQ-)RS: mise à jour du statut
    MQ-)NS: notification au citoyen
    IS-)MQ: InterventionCompleted
    MQ-)ES: ouverture de la notation
    C->>FE: Note la réparation
    FE->>GW: POST /api/feedbacks
    GW->>ES: POST /api/feedbacks
    ES->>RS: GET /api/reports/{id} (OpenFeign)
    ES-->>FE: 201 Created
